[0.002, "o", "\u001b[1;39m[\u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"count\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"lastMarkedAt\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m]\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\nField notes (see docs/model-capacity-and-telemetry.md, \"Manual recipe\"):\r\n  version        OPTIONAL on read; always rewritten as 1\r\n  providers      OPTIONAL map of provider-scoped windows (quota / 429)\r\n  models         OPTIONAL map of endpoint-scoped windows (transient / unavailable / auth)\r\n  .until         REQUIRED, epoch ms: the window end  (until <= now means expired)\r\n  .reason        REQUIRED, display only (never branch on it: a merge can pair it)\r\n  .escalations   OPTIONAL per entry: absent for hinted and model-scoped windows\r\n  .lastMarkedAt  OPTIONAL per entry: when the window was marked; absent in older files\r\n  escalations    OPTIONAL ladder map (count + lastMarkedAt), outlives the window 7 days\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\n========== 5. BACKWARD COMPATIBILITY: a pre-bd-38 file still loads (and is upgraded on the next mark) ==========\r\n\r\n$ node /tmp/bd38-proof/06-legacy.mjs /tmp/bd38-proof/legacy.json\r\n"]
