[0.001, "o", "\r\n\r\n========== 8. BEHAVIOUR 7: reactive skip end-to-end through the built fallback loop ==========\r\n\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "The built spawnAgentWithFallback spawns a real child process per candidate\r\n(BELAYD_PI_BINARY = a stand-in pi that emits the real pi JSONL shape and the live\r\nopencode-go 429 body). It logs every invocation, so the process count is evidence.\r\n"]
