[0.000, "o", "\r\n========== 9. TARGETED TESTS (names visible) ==========\r\n\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "Behaviour -> the test name that asserts it (all four files run below):\r\n  1  6 h not 15 min : \"uses the long provider window for an unhinted GoUsageLimitError body\"\r\n  2  hint wins      : \"parses the reset hint out of the live GoUsageLimitError body\" (7 h 57 m > 6 h)\r\n                      \"lets a parsed hint win over the long provider window\" (20 min > 6 h)\r\n  3  ladder         : \"doubles an unhinted provider window that is still cooling\"\r\n                      \"clamps the escalated window at the hard ceiling\"\r\n                      \"escalates even after the previous window expired inside the memory horizon\"\r\n  4  hint clears    : \"treats a hinted reset as authoritative and clears the ladder\"\r\n                      \"persists a hinted reset that is shorter than the escalated window\"\r\n  5  cross-process  : \"sees a cooldown written by another store instance sharing the same file\"\r\n  6  file shape     : \"loads a version-1 file written before escalation existed\"\r\n                      \"skips only the malformed entries of a hand-edited file\"\r\n  7  reactive skip  : \"cools the provider for hours, so 15 minutes later it is still skipped\"\r\n                      \"escalates the provider window on a repeated unhinted 429\"\r\n\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "$ pnpm test src/__tests__/quota-failure.test.ts --reporter=verbose\r\n"]
[1.661, "o", " ✓ src/__tests__/quota-failure.test.ts > classifySpawnFailure > classifies a clean assistant turn as success 3ms\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", " ✓ src/__tests__/quota-failure.test.ts > classifySpawnFailure > classifies non-zero exit without an error event as other 1ms\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", " ✓ src/__tests__/quota-failure.test.ts > classifySpawnFailure > classifies a 429 error as quota and parses the reset hint 1ms\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", " ✓ src/__tests__/quota-failure.test.ts > classifySpawnFailure > classifies a 402 error as quota with the default cooldown 1ms\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", " ✓ src/__tests__/quota-failure.test.ts > classifySpawnFailure > classifies 401 and 403 as auth 0ms\r\n"]
